+- **Auth**: Active member of `:id` (human session or agent with `bus:read`).
+- **Query Parameters**:
+  - `include_removed` (optional): `"true"` | `"false"` (default `"false"`). When `"true"`, includes removed members (`removed_at !== null`) for audit/history visibility.
+- **Response `200 OK`**:
